    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970415.0197.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970415.0197\n\nNEW DELHI, April 15 , 1997 (AFP)\n\n21 Hindu pilgrims die in Indian road crash\n\n\n\n\nAt least 21 Hindu pilgrims were killed and several injured when a truck and a tractor collided head-on in the central Indian district of Basti, the United News of India said Tuesday.\n\nTen women and six children were among those killed in Monday night's collision, it said, adding that 17 of the victims, who were travelling on the tractor trailer, died instantly.\n\nThe pilgrims were heading to the holy Hindu town of Ayodhya to attend a religious ceremony.",
